        <item>
            <title>3.1.6</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 15:34:10 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>157</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.1.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- Panes showing another Mac's session now come back when Canopy relaunches, including after an update. They used to be dropped from the saved layout.
- A session whose folder was removed while it was still running (for example, a worktree deleted after its pull request merged) now comes back on relaunch instead of disappearing.
]]></description>
